---
description: Protect Cleanora identity, authorization, payments, secrets, and audit trails.
globs: "{src/**/*.ts,prisma/**}"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Deny by default and enforce permissions server-side.
- Validate ownership, actor state, bans, suspensions, and resource state at protected boundaries.
- Never log credentials, OTPs, tokens, secrets, full payment payloads, or sensitive personal data.
- Keep secrets in configured environment providers; never commit them.
- Rate-limit abuse-prone endpoints and use secure token generation and comparison.
- Verify payment webhook authenticity and idempotency; gateway redirects are not payment proof.
- Audit privileged writes with actor, reason, timestamp, and before/after evidence.
- Protect uploads and external callbacks against spoofing and unsafe content.
